{
  "id": "r01-l02",
  "unit": "r01-signs",
  "title": "Not allowed",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**X নিষেধ** is 'X is not allowed': **ধূমপান নিষেধ** 'No smoking', **প্রবেশ নিষেধ** 'No entry'. **নিষিদ্ধ** 'prohibited' is the stronger, official word.\n\n**অনুমতি ব্যতীত প্রবেশ নিষেধ** 'No entry without permission'. In speech you would say **অনুমতি ছাড়া ঢোকা মানা**: same meaning, everyday words.\n\n**Spelling:** নিষেধ and নিষিদ্ধ are spelled with **ষ**, though you say *sh*. **ক্ষ** in **সংরক্ষিত** is said *kkh*: *shongrokkhito*. **ব্য** is ব + য-ফলা: **ব্যতীত** *byatito*.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "nishedh",
      "bn": "নিষেধ",
      "tr": "nishedh",
      "en": "not allowed; forbidden",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: মানা. ধূমপান নিষেধ 'No smoking'. Spelled with ষ, said sh."
    },
    {
      "id": "nishiddho",
      "bn": "নিষিদ্ধ",
      "tr": "nishiddho",
      "en": "prohibited; banned",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: মানা. Stronger, official word than নিষেধ. ষ + short ি, then দ্ধ (দ + ধ)."
    },
    {
      "id": "dhumpan",
      "bn": "ধূমপান",
      "tr": "dhumpan",
      "en": "smoking",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: সিগারেট খাওয়া. ধূম 'smoke' + পান 'drinking': long ূ."
    },
    {
      "id": "onumoti",
      "bn": "অনুমতি",
      "tr": "onumoti",
      "en": "permission",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written)."
    },
    {
      "id": "byatito",
      "bn": "ব্যতীত",
      "tr": "byatito",
      "en": "without; except",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: ছাড়া. Written partner of ছাড়া. ব্য = ব + য (jo-fola); long ী."
    },
    {
      "id": "shongrokkhito",
      "bn": "সংরক্ষিত",
      "tr": "shongrokkhito",
      "en": "reserved; restricted",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). ং + ক্ষ (said kkh): shong-rok-khito."
    }
  ],
